# The raw eigenvalue spectra ARE tracked.  The rule that excluded them was
# written defensively before the first run; they turned out to total 832K for
# six models, and they are the one artefact in this repository that cannot be
# regenerated without renting a GPU again.  The paper's reproducibility section
# promises them, so they live in git.  Revisit only if a future run makes them
# genuinely large -- and then archive them somewhere, do not just ignore them.
archive/
